  "notes": "Potter elected one 'REP Committeeman' and one 'REP Committeewoman' per precinct in the April 23, 2024 primary, the most recent Republican committee election found. The county page currently links 2026 general-election results but no 2026 primary results file was found, so it was not confirmed whether committee seats were also on the 2026 primary ballot. A seat is 'filled' when a printed ballot candidate received votes, 'empty' when no candidate ran and zero write-in votes were cast, and 'unknown' when write-in votes were cast; this includes seats where the report names a write-in winner, because it does not show whether that person qualified or accepted. Appointments or vacancies since 2024 are not reflected."
